User senting a ticket regarding them getting a new Laptop and almost everything working.
They cannot find their department shared drive.

The user has done some troubleshooting on their own before sending this ticket:
- Everything else works on the new laptop
- My old laptop had the drive

They're remote working from home.

We log into their device through remote desktop.
We see that their VPN is not connected, Status down. We turn it on.

They need the engineering department drive we figure out by chatting directly with the user.

We find in our documentation the UNC for \\FILESERV01\departments\Engineering and insert it through the File Explorer by clicking
the ... at the top and inserting the UNC into the field.

This solved the problem. Ticket closed
